<title>NETHERLANDS: Smit Trafo posts H1 96 net of Dfl 1.5 mln.</title>
<headline>Smit Trafo posts H1 96 net of Dfl 1.5 mln.</headline>
<dateline>NIJMEGEN, Netherlands 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>H1 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			     1.5  vs   4.4 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover				61.5  vs  67.9</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     2.8  vs   1.7 loss</p>
<p>    Interest charges		     1.2  vs   1.2</p>
<p>    Tax					Nil  vs   1.5</p>
<p>Note - Smit Transformatoren NV postponed the announcement of its 1995 and first-half 1996 results from August 29. ABN AMRO owns 58.3 percent of Smit Trafo, which was floated on the Amsterdam stock exchange in October 1994.</p>
</text>
